* Meat of bovine animals (fresh/chilled 02.01 and frozen 02.02) and edible off‑al of bovine, swine, sheep, goats, horses, asses, mules or hinnies (02.06, US $5 / kg);  
* Milk powder in retail packs (04.02, US $4.25 / kg);  
* Natural honey – both wrapped/canned up to 2.5 kg (0409.00.10, US $5 / kg) and other honey (0409.00.90, US $3 / kg);  
* Fresh/chilled vegetables – tomato (07.02, US $0.50 / kg), carrot (07.06, US $0.40 / kg), green chili/sweet pepper (07.09, US $0.50 / kg) and capsicum (07.09, US $0.60 / kg);  
* Detailed categories of areca nuts and betel nuts (08.02 and 08.02‑sub‑codes) covering fresh‑green whole and split, dried whole and split, and semi‑processed forms, with values ranging from US $1.25 to $2.00 / kg.

